# Keep every text file LF in the repo and in working trees, whatever the OS or
# core.autocrlf setting. Without this, a Windows checkout can commit CRLF and turn a
# small change into a whole-file diff (#267).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never normalize or diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.exe binary
